---
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /404.html
title: Page not found
bodyClass: page page--not-found
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#
  The not-found page.

  Built as a way back rather than a dead end, in three widening steps: what the
  reader most likely meant (filled in by `not-found.js` from the URL they
  landed on), search, and the full shelf of games. The last two ship in the
  markup, so the page is useful before — and without — any JavaScript.
#}
<div class="not-found" data-not-found data-pagefind-ignore>
  <header class="not-found__head">
    <p class="eyebrow">404</p>
    <h1 class="not-found__title">That page isn’t here</h1>
    {# Filled in with the URL actually requested; without JS there is nothing
       truthful to put here, so it stays hidden rather than echoing /404.html. #}
    <p class="not-found__path" data-not-found-path hidden><code></code></p>
    <p class="not-found__lede" data-not-found-lede>
      Section anchors are kept forever, so a link that lands here is far more
      likely a typo than something that moved.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="not-found__block" data-not-found-suggestions hidden aria-labelledby="suggestions-title">
    <h2 class="section-title" id="suggestions-title">Did you mean</h2>
    <ul class="suggestion-list" data-not-found-list></ul>
  </section>

  <section class="not-found__block" aria-labelledby="search-title">
    <h2 class="section-title" id="search-title">Search everything</h2>
    <p class="not-found__hint">
      Every rulebook, summary and glossary term at once<span class="not-found__hint--shortcut">
      — or press <kbd>⌘K</kbd> from any page</span>.
    </p>
    {#
      Opens the one palette the site already has, rather than standing up a
      second search box that would have to be kept in step with it.
    #}
    <button type="button" class="button button--primary" data-not-found-search>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <circle cx="9" cy="9" r="5.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/>
        <path d="M13.2 13.2 17 17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
      Search the appendix
    </button>
  </section>

  <section class="not-found__block" aria-labelledby="all-games-title">
    <h2 class="section-title" id="all-games-title">
      All Games
      <span class="section-title__count">{{ games | length }}</span>
    </h2>

    <ul class="game-grid game-grid--compact">
      {% for slug, item in games %}
        <li class="game-tile">
          <a class="game-tile__link" href="{{ item.url }}">
            {% if item.meta.box_art %}
              <span class="game-tile__art">
                <img class="game-tile__image" src="{{ item.meta.box_art }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
              </span>
            {% endif %}
          </a>
          <div class="game-tile__body">
            <h3 class="game-tile__title"><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a></h3>
            <ul class="chip-row">
              {% for type in item.contentTypes %}
                <li><a class="chip" href="{{ type.url }}">{{ type.label }}</a></li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>
